# The other order of ral-zarek-guest-lecturer-skip-waits-while-time-vault-skips-the-turn-first (CR 616.1): Bot2 chooses
# Ral Zarek's effect for the turn that would begin, so that turn is skipped by it and the effect is used up (CR 614.10a);
# Time Vault, which did not apply, stays tapped. On Bot2's next turn the Vault offers its skip again on its own (no choice
# between effects is asked), and Bot2 declines it and takes turn 11.

